BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (employee only when their prior workload has a funded replacement; relabeling a technician as manager does not create) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (free capacity. Every recurring hour must land in a seat, contractor scope, or explicit owner workload.) Tj ET
